Breaking data model changes scores: del:2 + add:1, change matches:
-    currency_id = fields.Many2one('res.currency', string='Currency', related='pos_order_id.currency_id')
-    currency_rate = fields.Float(string='Conversion Rate', related='pos_order_id.currency_rate', help='Conversion rate from company currency to order currency.')
+    currency_ids = fields.Many2many('res.currency', string="Currencies")

Total Changes: 117

[IMP] point_of_sale: Add support for multi-currency payments

It's now possible to pay a POS order in a different currency than the
order's currency. The payment amount will be converted to the order's
currency using the conversion rate defined on the order.

closes odoo/odoo#282736

Taskid: 5110998
Signed-off-by: David Monnom (moda) <moda@odoo.com>

